    "notes": "C10. Six actual authored action stages each facing: left shield starts deployment, full guard opens, mask fixes a point, two-hand grip, torsion, complete spear separation. Independent final QA opened all four originals and approved actual1..3; left B2 and B3 preserve two distinct sections, no rejoined third staff. Shield remains anatomical LEFT; intact spear begins RIGHT. Fixed mask-crown-to-Feral-soles references exclude hair and weapon tips. Native spacing edits preserve complete poses and true transparent gutters. No intro collision, three-plan staging, equipment inventory or sound mechanic is certified. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
